<h1>Angel Oakley</h1>
<p>US House, 3rd District, on the Chicago ballot November 3, 2026. Party: Republican.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.libertyangel.us/" rel="nofollow noopener">Campaign site (libertyangel.us)</a></p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>Oakley&#39;s campaign policy page lists ten areas, including government accountability and transparency, election reform with national voter ID standards, cutting federal spending and small-business regulation, border security, and defending constitutional rights including free speech and the Second Amendment. She also lists balanced budgets, a prevention and patient-choice approach to healthcare she calls medical freedom, and privacy and accountability rules for AI and technology. Her BallotReady profile summarizes her positions as ending the surveillance state, cutting inflation and housing costs, shrinking the deficit, addressing chronic disease, and securing the border with immigration reform.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>BallotReady lists her work as a cannabis educator, advisor, and CBD broker since 2017 and in Airbnb hospitality and property management since 2023, with bachelor&#39;s and master&#39;s degrees from Judson University.</p>
